# Everything here is optional. The app runs with an empty .env as long as your
# Claude account is linked (see below), and the Setup page in the app tells you
# exactly what is and is not ready on this machine.

# --- Your Claude account ----------------------------------------------------
# Model calls run on your own Claude Pro or Max subscription. No API key, no
# per-token billing, and no credentials are stored in this repository.
#
# Option A (simplest): install Claude Code, run `claude`, and sign in with
#   /login once on this machine. Leave everything here blank.
#
# Option B (headless, Docker, or a remote box): mint a long lived subscription
#   token with `claude setup-token` and paste it here.
# CLAUDE_CODE_OAUTH_TOKEN=

# --- Toolchain overrides ----------------------------------------------------
# Only needed when a tool is installed somewhere the server cannot find it.
# CXX=clang++
# PYTHON=python3
# JAVAC=/usr/lib/jvm/jdk-21/bin/javac
# JAVA=/usr/lib/jvm/jdk-21/bin/java
# GO=/usr/local/go/bin/go
# RUSTC=/home/you/.cargo/bin/rustc
# CLANGD=/usr/bin/clangd

# --- Server -----------------------------------------------------------------
# PORT=3001
# HOST=127.0.0.1
